Whoa why does this moment feel so familiar?

74
00:03:55,140 --> 00:03:57,040
Hey it's the scary lady

75
00:03:57,540 --> 00:03:59,040
Captain Merrilyuna

76
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:02,040
You should do something about that weak door of yours

77
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:04,840
Oh hello there, what can we do for you today ma'am?

78
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,540
I don't say yummy, but that's fine

79
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:10,940
Everyone in this room is coming with me immediately

80
00:04:11,740 --> 00:04:16,740
I have nothing but bad feelings about this!

81
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:20,740
You could have always saw me finish eating my food!

82
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:22,740
Yay! This'll be fun!

83
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:26,740
With all due respect, ma'am, can you just kidnap a whole squad this way?

84
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:28,740
Could you maybe at least tell us where we're going?

85
00:04:28,740 --> 00:04:30,740
Quiet! You'll see shortly.

86
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:40,740
I'm confused.

87
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:45,740
Wait, what just happened? One minute we're at the hideout and now we're surrounded by molten lava?

88
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:47,740
Oh, how exciting is this?

89
00:04:49,740 --> 00:04:53,740
I can feel the calories burning away and I've got nothing to replace them with!

90
00:04:53,740 --> 00:04:57,740
Oh, right. I guess this place can throw you for a loop if you haven't been here before.

91
00:04:57,740 --> 00:05:00,740
It's a strong magic region. Yultim Volcano.

92
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:02,740
Yultim, huh?

93
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:06,740
Excuse me, ma'am, but why exactly did you bring us here?

94
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:08,740
For your training, of course!

95
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:09,740
Oh, right.

96
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:14,740
Leo! Captain Feigalion!

97
00:05:14,740 --> 00:05:16,740
It's good to see my rival again.

98
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:20,740
You must have been pretty busy lately dealing with the elf attack and a devil.

99
00:05:20,740 --> 00:05:24,740
That's right. I heard that you were on the front lines fighting with the Crimson Lion Kings.

100
00:05:24,740 --> 00:05:27,740
Wait, is it just me or have you gotten taller?

101
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:32,740
Yeah, but that's not the only thing different about me. I've been improving my skills as a mage, too.

102
00:05:32,740 --> 00:05:36,740
Oh, really? Well, my muscles are bigger, so I'll still beat you!

103
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:40,740
Hello, Black Bulls. Can you spare a moment?

104
00:05:40,740 --> 00:05:41,740
Huh?

105
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:46,740
I happen to be the vice-captain of the Crimson Lion Kings. My name is Randall Lufthair.

106
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:51,740
During the last battle, the three of us had our bodies taken over by elves.

107
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:56,740
Even though we weren't in control of our actions, we're exceedingly sorry for betraying our land.

108
00:05:56,740 --> 00:06:02,740
Don't apologize. None of us are to blame for what happened except for the devil who messed with everybody's heads.

109
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:06,740
And I hear the devil in the spade kingdom is an even greater threat.

110
00:06:06,740 --> 00:06:09,740
Our squads must be strong to protect our nation.

111
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:15,740
But in order to prove Asta's innocence, we'll each have to improve ourselves individually as well.

112
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:22,740
Precisely, so just like before, my own squad, the Crimson Lion Kings, will be training alongside the others I invited.

113
00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:23,740
Right!

114
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:27,740
We weren't so much invited as abducted, but sure, whatever.

115
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:32,740
Here we go! Let's race to the top so we can hit that sweet hot spring!

116
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:34,740
Hold it!

117
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:39,740
There'll be no climbing this time. Instead, I'm going to have you venture below.

118
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:42,740
To the underground cave!

119
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:43,740
Huh?

120
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:44,740
There's a cave?

121
00:06:44,740 --> 00:06:46,740
But what's down there?

122
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:49,740
This place is a strong magic region.

123
00:06:49,740 --> 00:06:54,740
Because deep beneath the surface lies a great mana heat source.

124
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:59,740
Rocks that are soaked in that mana become lava and burst upward.

125
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:05,740
Which means, the further you descend, the more intense the heat source's influence will become.

126
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:12,740
If your mana skin falters, your body will be exposed to the extreme heat

127
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:15,740
and you will be reduced to ashes.

128
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:24,740
However, you'll be pleased to hear that the hot spring awaiting you in the deepest part of the cave is even more satisfying than the one at the peak.

129
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:28,740
Now then! Does that motivate you?

130
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:29,740
Hot spring.

131
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:36,740
Yeah, I don't like this! I'd be a lot more comfortable in a sweet region overflowing with honey, not lava!

132
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:38,740
Believe me, you're not ready for that!

133
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:40,740
It's real?

134
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:43,740
Okay, someone gonna tell me what mana skin means?

135
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:50,740
It's a defensive technique. To put it simply, it's a way of enhancing your physical abilities through mana.

136
00:07:51,740 --> 00:07:53,740
It's magic in its perfect state.

137
00:07:53,740 --> 00:08:00,740
Simply wrap your magic around yourself and it will form a protective shield of mana to cover your body.

138
00:08:01,740 --> 00:08:04,740
Hang on, you can't expect us to do it right off the bat!

139
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:06,740
Then I guess you'll just be incinerated.

140
00:08:06,740 --> 00:08:07,740
Oh, thanks!

141
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:13,740
Since you were brought here unexpectedly, I suppose it's only fair that I allow you to use this magic item.

142
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:18,740
What is it?

143
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:23,740
Something that will make it a little easier for you all to call upon your mana skin.

144
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:25,740
But it's only a supplement.

145
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:30,740
So if you lose control of your magic, then it will no longer be effective.

146
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,740
Oh, yeah! It's time to get started!

147
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:37,740
I've got flame magic, so I'm pretty sure a volcano will be a sitch.

148
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:41,740
Now I'm gonna fight fire with fire and blaze a trail to the finish line!

149
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:45,740
That's what you think, Leo! I'll fight as hard as I can to make it to the goal before you!

150
00:08:45,740 --> 00:08:49,740
Wait a sec, genius. How are you planning to do that if you can't use mana skin?

151
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:54,740
That anti-magic technique takes a lot out of you and doesn't last long.

152
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:56,740
If it wears off, you're toast!

153
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,740
I know!

154
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:04,740
In the past, I was able to switch over to my dark form by using the power flowing through the sword and into my body.

155
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:10,740
I didn't really have any control of it at the time, but luckily, I can handle it a little bit better now.

156
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:17,740
I'm gonna concentrate and focus my powers. That way I won't get sucked in by the magic inside the cave!

157
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:22,740
Not bad!

158
00:09:22,740 --> 00:09:25,740
He surrounded himself with anti-magic.

159
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:27,740
Right. This should do it!

160
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:31,740
Hey! That's pretty impressive! Now I'm really ready to take you on!

161
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:37,740
Yeah, I'm ready too! I don't have time to be scared! I gotta figure out how to use mana skin so I don't get barbecued!

162
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,740
Aw, Magna's a chicken!

163
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:42,740
Come here and say that again, smart guy!

164
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:44,740
Poor little scaredy cat!

165
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:46,740
Shut your freakin' mouth!

166
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:52,740
Mana skin... I should be able to put it on using my Valkyrie armor.

167
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,740
Hmph.

168
00:09:53,740 --> 00:10:00,740
I see you're all prepared. Remember, you are the esteemed magic knights who serve this kingdom.

169
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:06,740
One thing should burn far hotter than the mana inside this volcano. Your desire to pass this test!

170
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:07,740
Yeah!

171
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:12,740
I'm gonna get there first!

172
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:13,740
No me!

173
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:14,740
No me!

174
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:15,740
No me!

175
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:16,740
No me!

176
00:10:16,740 --> 00:10:17,740
No me!

177
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,740
Hot spring.

178
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:20,740
I won't be beaten either.

179
00:10:20,740 --> 00:10:23,740
Better hurry! You don't wanna get left behind, do ya?

180
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:24,740
You itch!

181
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,740
No time to waste!

182
00:10:26,740 --> 00:10:27,740
Right!

183
00:10:27,740 --> 00:10:28,740
Sneaky sneak.

184
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:30,740
Charmy, you're leaving?

185
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:31,740
Sheesh!

186
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:36,740
This place obviously doesn't have any restaurants, so there's no reason for me to stay! A girl's gotta eat, you know?

187
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:37,740
Yeah, but...

188
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:39,740
I won't stop you.

189
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:40,740
Huh?

190
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:51,740
Scorching hot mana isn't the only danger in this cave. You'll also face fearsome creatures that have adapted to those conditions. If you lack the desire to improve, then flee.

191
00:10:51,740 --> 00:10:57,740
That's right. I want to get stronger so I can help my friends. I can't turn back.

192
00:10:57,740 --> 00:11:00,740
So the creatures that live here, are they yummy?

193
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:03,740
More so than you can fathom.

194
00:11:03,740 --> 00:11:09,740
I'm sold! Let's go down there and taste those undiscovered trees marinated in extra spicy mana!

195
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:11,740
Wait for me!

196
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:15,740
I'm eager to see how many of them will be able to make their way to the goal.

197
00:11:15,740 --> 00:11:19,740
Hmph. It'd be too boring if it were just a simple race.

198
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:21,740
Hmph.

199
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:27,740
When I decided that this cave would be their training ground, I had much more in mind.

200
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:45,740
I'm gonna be the first one there, so you might as well give up already!

201
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:47,740
Hold it, you slowpump!

202
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:50,740
Don't you move!

203
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:51,740
Ow, it's so hot!

204
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:59,740
The deeper we go, the thicker that crazy mana gets, and the more it starts to wear out our bodies.

205
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:02,740
Oh man, I'm so tired and dizzy.

206
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:05,740
All I can do is yell really loud!

207
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,740
I won't give up!

208
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:09,740
You can't beat me, Asta!

209
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:12,740
Hey Nero, what was the point of you coming here?

210
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:14,740
Well, there's a hot spring.

211
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:16,740
So it's a vacation for you!

212
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:20,740
They're so noisy!

213
00:12:20,740 --> 00:12:23,740
It's making it harder to concentrate on my magic.

214
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:25,740
Just calm down, Noelle.

215
00:12:25,740 --> 00:12:27,740
If you get mad, you'll lose control.

216
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:31,740
On second thought, they both died today.

217
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:32,740
Pick up the pace!

218
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:35,740
Asta and Leo are about to leave us behind!

219
00:12:35,740 --> 00:12:38,740
Let's show them what the Crimson Lion Kings are made of!

220
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:39,740
Sir!

221
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:41,740
That's the spirit!

222
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:50,740
The heat from this mana is no joke.

223
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:53,740
Magic item or not, if I slip up, I'll burn to death.

224
00:12:55,740 --> 00:12:56,740
Whoops! Sorry, Magma!

225
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:59,740
You did that on purpose, brat!

226
00:13:01,740 --> 00:13:02,740
That's it!

227
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:04,740
You are so dead!

228
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:07,740
Also, are you sure this is even a shortcut to the goal?

229
00:13:07,740 --> 00:13:09,740
Shouldn't we be going down?

230
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:12,740
I'm not too sure, but it doesn't really matter

231
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:14,740
because apparently there's a super tough opponent up here somewhere

232
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:16,740
and I'm just itching to fight!

233
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:18,740
What? And you weren't planning on telling me?

234
00:13:18,740 --> 00:13:21,740
We don't have time for a side mission, you dumbass!

235
00:13:21,740 --> 00:13:26,740
Whoever it is, this aura is crazy powerful!

236
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:27,740
