237
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:31,740
Hi-yah!

238
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:34,740
Now come to Mama!

239
00:13:34,740 --> 00:13:36,740
It's so hot!

240
00:13:36,740 --> 00:13:38,740
My mana's draining faster than expected!

241
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:42,740
Listen, Charmy, it's not safe for us to be down here for very much longer!

242
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:47,740
Huh? But we need to eat the tasty mystery creatures so we can replenish our magic power!

243
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:53,740
I don't know, I haven't seen you catch a single thing. I'm starting to think there's nothing here.

244
00:13:53,740 --> 00:13:57,740
That can't be right! I sense them! They have to be nearby!

245
00:13:58,740 --> 00:14:03,740
I get it now! The monsters must be hiding because they're afraid of something!

246
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:05,740
It's probably you.

247
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:09,740
No!

248
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:16,740
It's so powerful, Charmy! Come on! You have to let go of the net now!

249
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:19,740
I'm not letting my snack get away!

250
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:21,740
